      "description": "Static excerpt of the onboarding example receipt; deliberately labeled illustrative. Not user transaction data.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-receipt-stage\"><article class=\"ds-receipt\" aria-label=\"Example receipt\"><h3 class=\"ds-merchant\">Lime Café</h3><p class=\"ds-date\">12 Oct 2026 · 10:24 AM</p><div class=\"ds-receipt-rule\"></div><div class=\"ds-line\"><span>Iced latte</span><span>RM 11.50</span></div><div class=\"ds-line\"><span>Butter croissant</span><span>RM 7.00</span></div><div class=\"ds-receipt-rule\"></div><div class=\"ds-line\"><span class=\"ds-total-label\">Total</span><strong class=\"ds-total\">RM 18.50</strong></div><p class=\"ds-category\">Example receipt</p></article></div>",
      "css": ".ds-receipt-stage{background:#DFF7E2;border-radius:32px;padding:30px;display:grid;place-items:center}.ds-receipt{width:225px;padding:18px 20px 13px;border-radius:8px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#093030;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;transform:rotate(-5deg);box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(4,42,38,.14)}.ds-merchant{margin:0;text-align:center;font-size:18px;line-height:29px;letter-spacing:-.4px;font-weight:700}.ds-date{margin:1px 0 0;color:#617470;text-align:center;font-size:9px;line-height:15px}.ds-receipt-rule{border-top:1px dashed #C9DAD4;margin:13px 0}.ds-line{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:7px;font-size:10px;line-height:19px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-total-label{font-size:12px}.ds-total{font-size:17px;line-height:28px;letter-spacing:-.4px}.ds-category{margin:13px 0 0;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #C9DAD4;text-align:center;color:#617470;font-size:9px;line-height:15px}"
